WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.458
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:09.386 --> 00:00:10.840
MAGDA JARY: Hi, Gabby.

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:14.155
How did this cloud certification
journey begin for you?

00:00:14.155 --> 00:00:17.470
GABRIELLA QUERALES:
So it began because I

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:21.290
wanted to have limitless
possibilities in my career.

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:25.000
And I knew a Google
Cloud certification

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.400
will allow me to do that.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.620
MAGDA JARY: And what was
your key personal motivation

00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:32.380
behind earning a Google
Cloud certification?

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:35.680
GABRIELLA QUERALES: I wanted
to master the technology that

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:38.240
is shaping our life every day.

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:40.560
And for me, Google
Cloud technologies

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:43.510
and cloud technologies,
in general, they do that.

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:45.550
MAGDA JARY: How would
you encourage someone new

00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:48.490
into the world of cloud to set
a goal of achieving a Google

00:00:48.490 --> 00:00:50.323
Cloud certification?

00:00:50.323 --> 00:00:51.740
GABRIELLA QUERALES:
Three things--

00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:54.880
the first thing, know
that it can be done.

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:57.100
Even if you don't have the
right cloud background,

00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:58.960
the right technology
background, it

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:01.340
can be done because I did it.

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:07.400
The second thing is that accept
that is going to be hard.

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:11.050
It's going to require a lot of
sacrifice, a lot of commitment

00:01:11.050 --> 00:01:12.610
and discipline.

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:18.110
And the third thing, know
that it's totally worth it.

00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:20.110
So go for it.

00:01:20.110 --> 00:01:23.460
[MUSIC PLAYING]

